                    <CheatEntry>
                      <ID>20</ID>
                      <Description>"Aldrich dark sun fix"</Description>
                      <VariableType>Auto Assembler Script</VariableType>
                      <AssemblerScript>{
For those unfortunate PvE players, and as a CE lua/Param Patcher example.
Also a little neat trick (I like to think) for the people that like
to patch params often.

Gate d17/m01/y2020
bad lua fixed by even bigger reetar (cih)
}
{$lua}
if syntaxcheck then return end
[enable]
writeInteger(
    string.format(
        "[[%x]+68]+318",
        paramUtils:getParamAddress("Ceremony")+104
    ),
    2404
)
[disable]
</AssemblerScript>
