13000000:Cemetary of Ash - Enable Warp to High Wall of Lothric
13000009:High Wall of Lothric - High Wall of Lothric
13000005:High Wall of Lothric - Tower on the Wall
13000002:High Wall of Lothric - Vordt of the Boreal Valley
13000004:High Wall of Lothric - Dancer of the Boreal Valley
13000001:High Wall of Lothric - Oceiros, the Consumed King
13100004:Undead Settlement - Foot of the High Wall
