14500006:Painted World of Ariandel - Champion's Gravetender]]
local bonfiresAddendumDLC2 = [[
15000001:The Dreg Heap - The Dreg Heap
15000002:The Dreg Heap - Earthen Peak Ruins
15000003:The Dreg Heap - Within the Earthen Peak Ruins
15000000:The Dreg Heap - The Demon Prince
